        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-MELROSE-PC\"><b>Laurey Melrose Polished Chrome Cabinet Bar Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Melrose Polished Chrome Cabinet Bar Pull is a great addition to any modern kitchen. The sleek, simple lines of these slim cabinet pull make it modern and the Polished Chrome color finishes the look. The Polished Chrome Melrose Cabinet Pull comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from a few different lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Melrose Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-87026:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87126:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87226:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87326:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87426:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87526:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87626:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13.-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
